#~ msgstr "Adder MK6"

#, fuzzy
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The mark 6 Adder is a small upgrade compared to the highly successful "
#~ "mark 5 model. Since people still prefer the more familiar and reliable "
#~ "mark 5, the mark 6 has not seen the same level of success."
