#~ "A high-velocity lead impactor (HVLI) fires a simple slug of lead at a "
#~ "high velocity. This weapon is usually found in simpler ships since it "
#~ "does not require guidance computers. This also means its projectiles fly "
#~ "in a straight line from its tube and can't pursue a target.\n"
